{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311440","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1231144001:0":{"text":"답은 뻔하죠.","source_cn":"答案显而易见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF752FDA2243EC1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231144002:0":{"text":"항구의 일은 대부분 따분해요. 술 마시는 건 일꾼들이 쉴 수 있는 유일한 방법이죠.","source_cn":"港口的大多数工作都很枯燥乏味，喝酒是工人放松的唯一方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC54EDE17EDDB4E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231144003:0":{"text":"원하는 것이 있으면 사장님께 말씀하세요. 사장님의 허락이 있어야 내어 드릴 수 있거든요.","source_cn":"想要什么，就去和我们老板说。他点头，我才能给你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2104320A25439B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍者奇卡瓦":{"text":"사환 치카바","source":"侍者奇卡瓦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}